# AI file map
# Purpose: constrain the existing formatter's file scope through ignore/reinclude patterns.
# Entry: Prettier consults this file only when formatting is explicitly requested.
# Flow: the root default is excluded and maintained paths are selectively re-included;
# Tauri generated artifacts remain excluded.
# Invariant: do not reorder negated patterns casually or run repository-wide formatting
# as a side effect of documenting source files.

# Ignore everything
/*

# Except these files & folders
!/src
!index.html
!package.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.node.json
!vite.config.ts
!.prettierrc
!README.md
!eslint.config.js
!.vscode/

!/scripts
!/tests
!/PRODUCT.md
!/DESIGN.md

src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/
